  Al     0.0000000000     0.0000000000     0.0000000000
  S      0.5000000000     0.2939990008     0.8753299996
  S      0.5000000000     0.7060009992     0.1246700004
  S      0.0000000000     0.2060009992     0.3753299996
  S      1.0000000000     0.7939990008     0.6246700004
K_POINTS automatic
